ADReplicationSiteAll.png","line":60,"embedded":true},{"title":"`Get-ADReplicationSiteLink` command","target":"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/activedirectory/get-adreplicationsitelink?view=windowsserver2019-ps","line":66},{"title":"Get the Inter-Site link details.","target":"https://adamtheautomator.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Get-ADReplicationSiteLink.png","line":70,"embedded":true},{"title":"`Get-ADReplicationSubnet` command","target":"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/activedirectory/get-adreplicationsubnet","line":76},{"title":"Get Subnet details.","target":"https://adamtheautomator.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Get-ADReplicationSiteSubnet.png","line":78,"embedded":true},{"title":"`New-ADReplicationSite` command","target":"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/activedirectory/new-adreplicationsite?view=windowsserver2019-ps","line":92},{"title":"`Select-Object` cmdlet","target":"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/microsoft.powershell.utility/select-object?view=powershell-7.1","line":100},{"title":"Add a new Site in PowerShell.","target":"https://adamtheautomator.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/New-ADReplicationSite.png","line":108,"embedded":true},{"title":"`New-ADReplicationSubnet` command","target":"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/activedirectory/new-adreplicationsubnet?view=windowsserver2019-ps","line":112},{"title":"CIDR notation","target":"https://www.keycdn.com/support/what-is-cidr#:~:text=CIDR%2C%20which%20stands%20for%20Classless,the%20growth%20of%20routing%20tables","line":112},{"title":"Add a new Subnet to AD Sites.","target":"https://adamtheautomator.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/New-ADReplicationSubnet.png","line":120,"embedded":true},{"title":"`New-ADReplicationSiteLink` command","target":"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/activedirectory/new-adreplicationsitelink?view=windowsserver2019-ps","line":124},{"title":"Adding the replication link between sites. ","target":"https://adamtheautomator.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/New-ADReplicationSiteLink.png","line":134,"embedded":true},{"title":"`Set-ADReplicationSiteLink` command","target":"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/activedirectory/set-adreplicationsitelink?view=windowsserver2019-ps","line":138},{"title":"Opening Active Directory Sites and Services.","target":"https://adamtheautomator.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/start-menu.png","line":146,"embedded":true},{"title":"Active Directory Sites and Services","target":"https://adamtheautomator.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Untitled-31-3.png","line":157,"embedded":true},{"title":"Fully expanded Sites and Services tool for the examples in the article.","target":"https://adamtheautomator.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Untitled-32-3.png","line":168,"embedded":true},{"title":"netlogon.log file","target":"https://adamtheautomator.com/netlogon-log/","line":176},{"title":"Using Set-ADReplicationSiteLink to remove a site from a link.","target":"https://adamtheautomator.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Set-ADReplicationSiteLink2.png","line":189,"embedded":true},{"title":"`Remove-ADReplicationSiteLink` command","target":"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/activedirectory/remove-adreplicationsitelink?view=windowsserver2019-ps","line":193},{"title":"Removing the Active Directory site link","target":"https://adamtheautomator.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Remove-ADReplicationSiteLink.png","line":201,"embedded":true},{"title":"Remove-ADReplicationSubnet","target":"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/activedirectory/remove-adreplicationsubnet?view=windowsserver2019-ps","line":205},{"title":"Removing the Active Directory Subnet associated with the Maryland site.","target":"https://adamtheautomator.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Remove-ADReplicationSubnet-1.png","line":212,"embedded":true},{"title":"`Remove-ADReplicationSite` command","target":"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/module/activedirectory/remove-adreplicationsite?view=windowsserver2019-ps","line":216},{"title":"Removing the Active Directory site","target":"https://adamtheautomator.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Remove-ADReplicationSite-1.png","line":223,"embedded":true},{"title":"Specops Password Auditor Free","target":"https://specopssoft.com/product/specops-password-auditor/?utm_source=ATA&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=ATA%20promo%202021&utm_content=SPA%20in-article%20link","line":227}],"metadata":{"created":"2022-03-10T13:26:20 (UTC +01:00)","tags":[],"source":"https://adamtheautomator.com/active-directory-site/","author":null},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[94,96],[102,104],[114,116],[128,130],[182,185],[195,199],[207,210],[218,221]],"key":"docs/Knowledge/PowerShell/ActiveDirectory/How to Manage Active Directory Sites with PowerShell.md"},
